  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYou're Barack Obama. 4 years into your retirement, you awake to find a letter with no return address on your bedside table. It reads \"I hope you've had a chance to relax Barack...but pack your bags and call the number below. It's time to start the real job.\" Signed simply, \"JFK.\" You think it might be a prank, but the phone number is real. \n\nObama picks up the pick and dials the number. The man on the other end of the phone tells him to meet him at the White House. The White House? he wonders. Why would he be getting called back to the White House? A car is then sent to pick him up. He reluctantly gets into the car. \n\nOnce Obama arrives at the White House, he's escorted to the Oval Office. When he walks into the oval office, he finds JFK standing there waiting for him. \"Welcome back, Mr. President.\" Obama said nothing. He was speechless. \n\n\"Would you like a drink Mr. President?\" He poured himself a cocktail as Obama stood there. \"No, thank you.\" he replied politely. \"Well, I'm just gonna go on and get to the point. The country needs your help.\" He continued. \"We have received information detailing a plan to overtake the government and start a new fascist regime. You are the only one that can stop them.\"",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 5,
  "reference_text": " Obama sat down. \"I don't know how,\" he said earnestly. \"What makes you think I can do this?\" \n\nJFK smiled. \"I will show you. First you have to make a choice.\" He held out both of his hands and opened them. In each hand was a pill.",
